<%@ include file="header.jspf" %>
<h1><c:out value="${ticket.name}"/></h1><div class="session-status" data-view-expiry="${ticket.expiresAt}">Viewing session ends at <c:out value="${ticket.expiresAt}"/> UTC. <span id="remaining-time" role="status"></span><form method="post" action="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/viewer/close"><%@ include file="csrf.jspf" %><input type="hidden" name="session" value="${ticket.id}"><button>Close Viewer</button></form></div><p>Refresh reuses this session and does not consume another view. Closing or expiry does not refund a view. Use Close Viewer when finished; browser-close events are unreliable, so server expiry is authoritative. Screenshots, recording and browser capture remain possible.</p><c:forEach begin="0" end="${ticket.pages-1}" var="number"><img class="viewer-page" alt="Watermarked page ${number+1}" src="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/viewer/page?session=${ticket.id}&amp;number=${number}"></c:forEach>
<%@ include file="footer.jspf" %>
